text+='\n## Determinism and compatibility\n\n'+f"Historical/payroll references: {len(refs.get('rows',[]))} exact unchanged comparisons. Clock proof: {clock.get('actualInitialStates')} initial states, {len(clock.get('fullRaces',[]))} full/ability comparisons, pass={clock.get('pass')}. See `references.json`, `championship-clock/parity.json`, and `legacy-continuity.json` for exact checksum pairs. The latter compares all nine frozen-v2 cases and old save/pending-offer reconstruction against the accepted archived runtime. Checkpoint/restart equality is also covered for every new-context ability. No expected checksum was changed.\n\n"
